{"findings":[{"id":"a637e811-d3f3-46a2-8d13-85ccabfe342b","title":"Modulo by zero crashes instead of returning NULL","description":"The zero-divisor guard in `apply` was narrowed from `Token::Slash | Token::Percent` to `Token::Slash`, so `%` with a zero right operand no longer returns `Ok(None)` and falls through to `Token::Percent => Some(a.wrapping_rem(b))`, which panics on a zero divisor. Any SQL containing modulo by zero, including nested forms such as `2 * (3 % 0)` and queries run through the sqllogictest harness, panics instead of yielding NULL, contradicting the README's documented \"Division or modulo by zero gives NULL.\" rule.","category":"Correctness","action_level":"action_required","attribution_status":"implemented","git_sha":"559dc2a00191c3ad16a6aa1cfbc151ae6b0885a0","location":{"file_path":"src/select.rs","start_line":156,"end_line":157,"side":"right"},"evidence":{"citations":[{"source_type":"rules","source":"https://app.qodo.ai/rules/5040758?state=active"},{"source_type":"pr_branch_file","source":"src/select.rs[153-161]"},{"source_type":"pr_branch_file","source":"README.md[69-69]"},{"source_type":"pr_branch_file","source":"src/select.rs[156-161]"},{"source_type":"pr_branch_file","source":"src/select.rs[716-735]"},{"source_type":"pr_branch_file","source":"tests/slt.rs[275-283]"}]}}],"finding_state":{"complete":true,"introduced":[],"resolved":["a637e811-d3f3-46a2-8d13-85ccabfe342b"],"still_open":[],"dismissed":[]},"review_agent_comment":"Nothing to comment.","meta":{"analysis":{"attempted_mode":"incremental","baseline_checkpoint_id":"9ed2037f7cee405e96fd81624b718a3e","mode":"full","profile_changed":false,"reason":"delta_scope_unavailable"},"checkpoint":{"base_sha":"559dc2a00191c3ad16a6aa1cfbc151ae6b0885a0","coverage_started_at":"2026-11-28T03:46:46.267576+00:00","created_at":"2026-11-28T03:46:46.267576+00:00","id":"b336d356e7604754835d8841fe811c33","sequence":42570,"tree_sha":"60552dad1310f8ed7a4a104f0e35a3d727b9a123","version":1},"context":{"ticket_bo